        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "As part of our Cancer Care Continuum strategy, we also plan to expand the number of biopharma partners we serve with services including biomarker identification and validation, companion diagnostic test development and regulatory registration, as well as companion diagnostic test commercialization.",
